# expect: 1000000000
# expect: 2000000000
# expect: 3000000000
# A NAMED (var-ref) each callback over a wide i64 stream is not monomorphized
# (only inline procs are), so OP_EACH pulls tagged (boxes the wide element) for
# the dyn-param callback. Regression guard for the each-callback param-rep
# signal (TYPED_CLOSURES_DESIGN.md Phase A).
proc main {} {
  def show [proc {x} { print $x }]
  for [transform [range 1 4] [\ $* $it 1000000000]] $show   # 1e9, 2e9, 3e9
}
main
